<title>USA: Wang Q1 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>Wang Q1 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>BILLERICA, Mass. 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>WANG LABORATORIES, INC.</p>
<p>		  (Dollars in millions, except pershare data)</p>
<p>							   Quarter Ended</p>
<p>							   September 30,</p>
<p>						 1996		    1995</p>
